### [1] AUTENTICACAO - Validacao de CPF (Lambda Serverless)
# Retorna JWT se o CPF existe no banco. CPF teste: 12345678909
POST https://94hgdxyf77.execute-api.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/Prod/auth
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cpf": "12345678909"
}

