### [6] Criar Cliente
POST http://35.83.151.56/api/v1/admin/clientes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

{
  "nome": "Mario Silva",
  "cpfCnpj": "17861341011",
  "email": "mario.silva@email.com",
  "telefone": "11987651234"
}

### [7] Criar Veiculo
POST http://35.83.151.56/api/v1/admin/veiculos
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

{
  "placa": "ABC-1234",
  "marca": "Toyota",
  "modelo": "Corolla",
  "ano": 2020,
  "clienteId": 2
}

### [8] Criar Peca
POST http://35.83.151.56/api/v1/admin/pecas
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

{
  "nome": "Filtro de Oleo",
